{"id":"4996","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4996_main_snow_hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>雪是冰晶的沉淀，单独或粘在一起，从云中落下。在温度高于约-5℃时，晶体通常粘在一起形成雪花。来自奥地利Thal的这张照片显示了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处从云层落下的雪花。</p>\n<p>至少在某种程度上降雪<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">通常会降低能见度</span>。中等或重度的下落雪花会大大降低能见度。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Danny Krull","location":"奥地利Thal","latitude":"纬度: 47° 55' 37'' N","longitude":"经度: 15° 54' 4'' E","date":"05 April 2015 1526 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.11.2.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.11.2.5"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/4996_syn_snow_hydrometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>暖锋给奥地利带来了降水。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4427_main_snow-shower-from-a-cumulonimbus_hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span> 处的积雨云虽仅有中度发展，但砧状形态和条纹状外观已十分明显。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span> 处正有阵雪从云中落下；雪在接近0°C等温线高度下方（略高于湖面海拔535米处）便转化为雨。当时该站受来自北至西北方向的海洋极地气流影响，导致斯堪的纳维亚地区出现异常寒冷的夏季天气及不稳定现象。</p></div>","copyright":"© T. Bergeron","location":"Ånn, Sweden","latitude":"纬度: 63° 19' 32'' N","longitude":"经度: 12° 32' 5'' E","date":"05 July 1951 1730 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= /, CM= /, CH= /","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}